me, the sumti. selma'o ME
converts sumti to selbri
x1 is specific to (Was Footnote: sumti) in aspect x2

----

roda zo'u da du xu lo me da

----

That's the old meaning. The new and generally agreed upon meaning, as explained in ((the Book)) is:

x1 is one of the referents of (Was Footnote: sumti)
